      "start_seconds": 0.89,
      "end_seconds": 4.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Hello, sorry about the delay, do sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.24,
      "end_seconds": 9.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.76,
      "end_seconds": 13.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Is this your first time with this clinic?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.38,
      "end_seconds": 21.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.01,
      "text": "Mm, first time with this one, yes. A friend recommended it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.65,
      "end_seconds": 24.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.5,
      "end_seconds": 29.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "It's a burn on my left forearm, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.79,
      "end_seconds": 38.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.34,
      "end_seconds": 40.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.59,
      "end_seconds": 45.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.88,
      "end_seconds": 54.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.43,
      "text": "Probably one week. Yeah. And there's redness around it as well, about four days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.9,
      "end_seconds": 60.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Any trouble breathing or burn on the face at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.76,
      "end_seconds": 66.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "No, no trouble breathing or burn on the face."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.02,
      "end_seconds": 72.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Have you noticed chemical exposure, fever or numbness at the burn?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.84,
      "end_seconds": 79.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "No chemical exposure, fever or numbness at the burn, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.28,
      "end_seconds": 86.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.11,
      "end_seconds": 89.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.47,
      "end_seconds": 93.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Alright, is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.77,
      "end_seconds": 97.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.71,
      "end_seconds": 102.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.62,
      "end_seconds": 105.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.03,
      "end_seconds": 110.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.66,
      "end_seconds": 113.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "I've got migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.38,
      "end_seconds": 123.86,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Yes, migraines is known to us, good to have that clear. A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.17,
      "end_seconds": 140.96,
      "duration_seconds": 15.79,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I quit smoking around ten years ago. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. No, I share a house with my brother. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.04,
      "end_seconds": 144.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.4,
      "end_seconds": 150.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "I had a mole taken off my arm a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.81,
      "end_seconds": 155.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.9,
      "end_seconds": 160.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.97,
      "end_seconds": 179.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.35,
      "end_seconds": 190.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.92,
      "end_seconds": 214.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 72 beats a minute, SpO2 97 percent on room air, BP is 108 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.34,
      "end_seconds": 218.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.53,
      "end_seconds": 222.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.58,
      "end_seconds": 245.52,
      "duration_seconds": 9.94,
      "text": "There is a five-centimetre area of redness with an intact blister on the left forearm, and it blanches and is painful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.27,
      "end_seconds": 250.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "You can relax now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.91,
      "end_seconds": 277.8,
      "duration_seconds": 10.89,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I don't have a clear answer today: a superficial partial-thickness burn is possible, and so is a scald with infection risk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.57,
      "end_seconds": 312.52,
      "duration_seconds": 26.95,
      "text": "I'm going to put you on paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. That should help with burn pain. Cool the area under running water for twenty minutes and cover it with a non-stick dressing, and leave the blister alone. Let's plan a check in three days. Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.58,
      "end_seconds": 324.85,
      "duration_seconds": 11.27,
      "text": "So, I take the paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed and come back in three days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.45,
      "end_seconds": 330.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.7,
      "end_seconds": 335.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.56,
      "end_seconds": 337.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
